  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Blocked by dog emperor Ying Ming while Tie clan holds the bronze hall, Xiao Mang flies out through a hole in the blessed land sky. Gather Light Gu at rank four pulls sunlight into a ball; rank five Extreme Light Gu infects that ball with the glory of the immemorial era; rank five River Under the Sun Gu turns the ball into an overwhelming water of light. The pairing is the killer move Torrential Light Stream.",
      "chapters": [
        397
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ying_ming",
        "fac_tie_clan",
        "char_xiao_mang",
        "gu_gather_light_gu",
        "gu_extreme_light_gu",
        "gu_river_under_the_sun_gu",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The light river pours into the blessed land, turns the battlefield white, and crashes on the purple barrier around the bronze hall. The barrier lasts only a moment before it shatters; the four Tie clan old-timers who held it spout blood and are gravely injured, and the weakened river still breaks into the hall. Fang Yuan leaves that hit with Warp Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        397
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-cast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_warp_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xiao Mang uses the same three Gu sequence again, and the light river breaks through the bronze hall roof.",
      "chapters": [
        404
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "glory-light-and-interruption",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Torrential Light Stream replicates the light of glory in some aspects, a light Extreme Light Gu can unleash only three times each month before risking self-detonation. Fang Yuan flies against the waterfall to refine Fixed Immortal Travel in that light; when Xiao Mang sees the refinement, he stops the killer move at once.",
      "chapters": [
        405
      ],
